Title: Two Scene Test
Author: Twopop

INT. ARCHIVE VAULT - NIGHT #1#

Rows of steel shelving. A single caged bulb swings.

MARA VOSS (40s, cropped grey hair, long oilskin coat) slips through the door, clutching a red leather LEDGER.

[[Push in on Mara as she clocks the guard.]]

DESMOND (60s, night guard, cardigan) looks up from his desk.

DESMOND
Archive's closed.

MARA
(holding up the ledger)
Not to me it isn't.

She crosses the room, left to right, and sets the ledger on his desk.

DESMOND
Where did you get that?

MARA
Your father.

INT. ARCHIVE VAULT - NIGHT - REVERSE #2#

From behind Desmond: Mara framed in the doorway light.

The camera pans with Desmond as he rounds the desk toward her.

DESMOND
Then you'd better sit down.

CUT TO:
